  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_008 (0.639 accuracy) is the top performer with pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation (which may capture richer interactions) while keeping RNA/image encoders and fusion method consistent. Transformer aggregation is more complex and likely more expensive (~15 GPU hours), but it could improve accuracy further. This balances exploitation of current best components with exploration of aggregation methods, prioritizing potential accuracy gains within remaining budget."
}

